        "id": 1056478
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-15T21:35:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the caller does not wish to receive incremental results, what would they pass in for the incrementalResultsPeriodicity?\n\nIt might make sense to employ the Builder pattern which allows the caller to specify the periodicity if incrementalResults is true.  \n\nAlternatively since everything else is a required parameter, you could just have two constructors.  One that specifies the incrementalResultsPEriodicity and one that doesn\u0027t.  If you specify a periodicity then you can assume mIncrementalResults is true.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "aaf5029f0b77ea52aaf30dee04cc96419c97b5bf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8a908ce7_9789af90",
        "filename": "telephony/java/android/telephony/NetworkScanRequest.java",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 128,
      "author": {
        "id": 1148298
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-15T23:33:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When caller does not want incremental results, they should set \"incremental \u003d false\", and the value of incrementalResultsPeriodicity will be ignored. \nI didn\u0027t use Builder pattern here, and didn\u0027t user two constructors either, because we have the same issue for \"scanType\" and \"searchPeriodicity\", when scanType is one shot scan, the value of searchPeriodicity will be ignored.\nIn stead of having 4 or even more constructors, I would recommend just use this single constructor and require the user to provide all the parameters. I also modified the comments to make it more clear, please let me know whether this acceptable in API council\u0027s point of view.",
      "parentUuid": "a47e8000_eb1ee06d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "aaf5029f0b77ea52aaf30dee04cc96419c97b5bf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
